Day 1

learnt about detailed roadmap of devops

it is total of 8 phases and 16 tools

Phase 1: Foundation

1.Linux
2.Git

Phase 2: Cloud Fundamentals (AWS)

3. AWS Core services

Phase 3: Containerisation & Orchestration

4.Docker
5.Kubernetes(Core+EKS)
6.Helm(Kubernetes packaging)
7.Argo CD

Phase 4: Infrastructure as Code & Configuration Management

8.Terraform
9.Ansible

Phase 5: CI/CD & DevOps Automation

10.Gitlab and Jenkins

Phase 6: Observability & Monitoring

11.Datadog
12.ELK Stack

Phase 7: Messaging & Streaming

13.Kafka/MSK/Confluent

Phase 8: Security & Reliability

14.SSL Certificates
15.SRE
16.Security tools
